JMComic Web Downloader

This project is a JavaScript port of algorithms from JMComic-Crawler-Python
(https://github.com/hect0x7/JMComic-Crawler-Python), via JMComic-Downloader-GUI
(https://github.com/keylight-leo86/JMComic-Downloader-GUI).

